---
// Asymmetric Double Image layout inspired by Tengile MalaMala's SectionDoubleImages
---

<section class="py-20 md:py-32 bg-[var(--tm-dark-surface)] border-y border-white/10 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="container-tm">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Story + Image 1 -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="mb-10 max-w-md">
          <span class="suptitle-tm">Ritme &amp; Konsistensi</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-[var(--tm-stone)] leading-snug mb-6">
            Mencatat Setiap Baris, Mengabadikan Setiap Ikhtiar
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-[var(--tm-stone)]/80 leading-relaxed font-light mb-6">
            Pendidikan ngaji adalah proses kesabaran harian. Baik santri yang tengah mengeja huruf hijaiyah pada jilid awal Iqro maupun yang tengah merampungkan hafalan juz 30, catatan capaian mereka berhak dirapikan secara bermartabat.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-[var(--tm-stone)]/80 leading-relaxed font-light">
            Tanpa tumpukan kertas absen basah, tanpa kebingungan saat buku prestasi tertinggal. Semua tersusun sistematis dalam satu alur sederhana.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Vertical Image 1 (Rehal) -->
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 group shadow-2xl">
          <img
            src="/images/rehal.jpg"
            alt="Mushaf Al-Qur'an di atas rehal kayu"
            class="w-full h-[380px] sm:h-[460px] object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[var(--tm-dark)]/80 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6">
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--tm-accent-gold)] font-medium block mb-1">
              Kurikulum Lengkap
            </span>
            <span class="font-serif text-xl text-white">
              Iqro 1-6 &amp; 114 Surat Al-Qur'an
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Taller Image 2 (Arches) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 group shadow-2xl">
          <img
            src="/images/arches.jpg"
            alt="Lorong arsitektur musholla yang tenang"
            class="w-full h-[520px] sm:h-[680px] object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[var(--tm-dark)]/80 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-8 left-8 right-8 max-w-md">
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--tm-accent-gold)] font-medium block mb-2">
              Lingkungan Belajar
            </span>
            <h4 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl text-white mb-3">
              Ketenangan Suasana, Kepastian Catatan
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-[var(--tm-stone)]/90 font-light leading-relaxed">
              Guru berfokus penuh menyimak bacaan tajwid santri. Formulir presensi bekerja kilat dan menyimpan data seketika dalam basis data peramban.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
